1
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:23,967
[HOST] In the late 1960s,

2
00:00:23,967 --> 00:00:27,780
America was deeply immersed in the
vibrant peak of the Hippie movement.

3
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:31,335
Hundreds of thousands of young
people flocked to California

4
00:00:31,335 --> 00:00:34,240
from across the nation to take
part in the Summer of Love.

5
00:00:34,940 --> 00:00:37,050
They wore flowers in
their hair and dreamed

6
00:00:37,050 --> 00:00:39,160
together of a free
world without prejudice.

7
00:00:40,180 --> 00:00:42,165
In the eyes of the youth at that time,

8
00:00:42,165 --> 00:00:44,620
the golden sunshine of
Los Angeles stood as the

9
00:00:44,620 --> 00:00:47,440
ultimate symbol of spiritual
awakening and liberation.

10
00:00:48,300 --> 00:00:51,306
Yet they could never have imagined
that this era of innocence

11
00:00:51,306 --> 00:00:53,820
was about to close forever
in a horrific nightmare.

12
00:00:54,900 --> 00:00:57,240
[HOST] That innocent romantic
picture shattered into

13
00:00:57,240 --> 00:00:59,580
a hundred pieces on one
fateful summer night.

14
00:00:59,940 --> 00:01:04,863
On the night of August 8 leading
into the morning of August 9, 1969,

15
00:01:04,863 --> 00:01:10,800
an unimaginable darkness descended upon
the luxurious estate at 10050 Cielo Drive.

16
00:01:11,720 --> 00:01:14,078
The secluded home nestled quietly on an

17
00:01:14,078 --> 00:01:16,920
isolated hillside near
glamorous Beverly Hills.

18
00:01:17,600 --> 00:01:20,541
The residence rented by
famed director Roman Polanski

19
00:01:20,541 --> 00:01:23,760
became the scene of a ruthless
collective violent assault.

20
00:01:24,960 --> 00:01:27,600
Five innocent lives were
extinguished in the blink of an eye.

21
00:01:28,680 --> 00:01:31,300
Among the victims was the
beautiful actress Sharon Tate,

22
00:01:31,300 --> 00:01:33,920
the director's wife who was
nearly nine months pregnant.

23
00:01:34,400 --> 00:01:38,180
Also perishing were four close
personal friends of the family.

24
00:01:39,780 --> 00:01:41,782
[HOST] Less than twenty-four hours later,

25
00:01:41,782 --> 00:01:44,549
a horrifyingly similar
tragedy unfolded at 3301

26
00:01:44,549 --> 00:01:47,140
Waverly Drive in the
Los Feliz neighborhood.

27
00:01:48,160 --> 00:01:51,253
Supermarket executive Leno
LaBianca and his wife Rosemary

28
00:01:51,253 --> 00:01:54,020
were brutally slain right
inside their living room.

29
00:01:54,720 --> 00:01:58,127
The rapid succession of these ruthless
assaults against innocent families

30
00:01:58,127 --> 00:02:01,300
completely shattered the sense of
safety across southern California.

31
00:02:02,260 --> 00:02:04,928
It marked the terrifying
beginning of an unprecedented

32
00:02:04,928 --> 00:02:07,200
collective paranoia in
American urban history.

33
00:02:07,760 --> 00:02:10,756
Let us listen to the poignant
perspective of a Los Angeles

34
00:02:10,756 --> 00:02:13,700
resident who lived through
those dark and agonizing days.

35
00:02:14,600 --> 00:02:15,554
[RESIDENT] On that morning,

36
00:02:15,554 --> 00:02:20,442
as the radio continuously broadcast reports
of the massacre at Sharon Tate's home,

37
00:02:20,442 --> 00:02:23,780
the entire city of Los Angeles
fell paralyzed with fear.

38
00:02:24,620 --> 00:02:28,440
No one dared to step outside their
front door once dusk began to fall.

39
00:02:29,820 --> 00:02:33,538
People rushed frantically to buy
firearms, reinforced window latches,

40
00:02:33,538 --> 00:02:37,580
and sought guard dogs until hardware
shelves were completely stripped bare.

41
00:02:38,560 --> 00:02:41,586
The most terrifying realization
was that the intruders

42
00:02:41,586 --> 00:02:44,500
had not acted for monetary
gain or valuable jewelry.

43
00:02:45,700 --> 00:02:49,270
Valuable belongings throughout the
villa remained entirely untouched.

44
00:02:49,320 --> 00:02:55,320
It was a display of cruelty that felt
completely senseless, arbitrary, and cold.

45
00:02:56,020 --> 00:02:58,380
Our Summer of Love died
right on that very night.

46
00:02:59,510 --> 00:03:02,001
[HOST] The crime scenes at
both residences left behind

47
00:03:02,001 --> 00:03:04,280
profoundly bizarre and
chilling signatures.

48
00:03:05,270 --> 00:03:07,940
There was no trace of an
ordinary burglary or robbery.

49
00:03:09,060 --> 00:03:13,885
Yet on the walls and front doors, the
perpetrators had scrawled unsettling words:

50
00:03:13,885 --> 00:03:17,340
“PIG”, “RISE”, and a misspelled
phrase: “HEALTER SKELTER”.

51
00:03:18,710 --> 00:03:20,930
The nation stood in utter shock asking:

52
00:03:20,930 --> 00:03:24,060
What possible motive could
drive such inhuman savagery?

53
00:03:24,940 --> 00:03:26,405
[INVESTIGATOR] During the initial weeks,

54
00:03:26,405 --> 00:03:29,100
the Los Angeles Police
Department found itself

55
00:03:29,100 --> 00:03:31,620
completely baffled by
an unsolvable puzzle.

56
00:03:32,100 --> 00:03:35,216
There was zero personal
connection between the family

57
00:03:35,216 --> 00:03:37,980
of actress Sharon Tate
and the LaBianca couple.

58
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:41,640
The two scenes were
separated by dozens of miles,

59
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:44,980
and the victims belonged to
entirely different social circles.

60
00:03:45,780 --> 00:03:46,523
Nevertheless,

61
00:03:46,523 --> 00:03:51,270
the physical staging at both locations
displayed the exact same chilling signature.

62
00:03:51,320 --> 00:03:53,085
From a forensic standpoint,

63
00:03:53,085 --> 00:03:57,660
we recognized that the killers had
not acted out of personal vendetta.

64
00:03:58,500 --> 00:04:00,809
They appeared to be executing a sinister

65
00:04:00,809 --> 00:04:03,580
theatrical script
orchestrated from the shadows.

66
00:04:04,500 --> 00:04:07,460
This was not the erratic
impulse of ordinary burglars.

67
00:04:08,260 --> 00:04:11,800
It was the calculated execution
of a fanatical command.

68
00:04:13,100 --> 00:04:14,680
[HOST] Welcome back to Amber Eyes.

69
00:04:15,480 --> 00:04:15,806
Today,

70
00:04:15,806 --> 00:04:18,469
we unlock one of the most
chilling and perplexing

71
00:04:18,469 --> 00:04:21,240
criminal psychology cases
of the twentieth century:

72
00:04:21,240 --> 00:04:24,500
the dossier of Charles Manson
and the Manson Family tragedy.

73
00:04:25,440 --> 00:04:29,386
We will dissect how a drifter who spent
more than half his life behind bars

74
00:04:29,386 --> 00:04:33,280
could transform educated youths into
unfeeling instruments of destruction.

75
00:04:33,980 --> 00:04:37,600
And how the subtle art of ego
dismantling wielded by a malignant

76
00:04:37,600 --> 00:04:40,880
narcissist operated to control
an entire collective tribe.

77
00:04:43,060 --> 00:04:46,787
[HOST] To trace the phantom pulling the
strings behind this string of nightmares,

78
00:04:46,787 --> 00:04:50,060
detectives were led far beyond
the glamorous villas of Hollywood.

79
00:04:50,900 --> 00:04:54,500
They ventured deep into the desolate
terrain of the Santa Susana Valley.

80
00:04:55,340 --> 00:04:59,000
Their destination was Spahn Ranch in
the rural outskirts of Chatsworth.

81
00:05:00,420 --> 00:05:03,218
It was a dilapidated movie
set previously used to shoot

82
00:05:03,218 --> 00:05:06,270
vintage Western cowboy films
of the early twentieth century.

83
00:05:06,320 --> 00:05:09,904
Among the decaying wooden shacks
and sun-bleached desert dust,

84
00:05:09,904 --> 00:05:14,760
an eerie commune of dozens of young people
lived entirely cut off from civilization.

85
00:05:15,940 --> 00:05:19,690
[INVESTIGATOR] They referred to
themselves by a disarmingly warm title:

86
00:05:19,690 --> 00:05:21,900
“The Family” (The Manson Family).

87
00:05:22,800 --> 00:05:25,703
The undisputed leader
commanding absolute authority

88
00:05:25,703 --> 00:05:28,150
across the ranch was
Charles Milles Manson.

89
00:05:28,200 --> 00:05:32,781
He was a thirty-four-year-old
man of slight physical stature,

90
00:05:32,781 --> 00:05:35,860
yet possessing a piercing, hypnotic gaze.

91
00:05:37,100 --> 00:05:38,696
Looking into his background,

92
00:05:38,696 --> 00:05:42,400
Manson was neither a learned guru
nor an enlightened philosopher.

93
00:05:43,380 --> 00:05:47,604
He was a seasoned transient criminal
who had spent more than half his

94
00:05:47,604 --> 00:05:51,950
life confined within juvenile
reformatories and federal penitentiaries.

95
00:05:52,000 --> 00:05:54,370
His rap sheet was filled with grand theft,

96
00:05:54,370 --> 00:05:56,740
check forgery, and procuring prostitution.

97
00:05:57,800 --> 00:06:00,143
[HOST] Upon his release
from prison in March 1967,

98
00:06:00,143 --> 00:06:02,976
Manson walked directly into
the beating heart of the

99
00:06:02,976 --> 00:06:05,700
Hippie movement in San
Francisco's Haight-Ashbury.

100
00:06:06,560 --> 00:06:10,408
Observing a counterculture captivated
by free love and naive idealism,

101
00:06:10,408 --> 00:06:13,101
Manson exploited the “Halo
Effect” of a wandering

102
00:06:13,101 --> 00:06:15,740
spiritual guru to cloak
his predatory instincts.

103
00:06:16,640 --> 00:06:19,536
Armed with an acoustic guitar
and melodic ballads of freedom,

104
00:06:19,536 --> 00:06:21,483
he quickly gathered rebellious youths who

105
00:06:21,483 --> 00:06:23,620
were drifting through
severe identity crises.

106
00:06:24,100 --> 00:06:28,940
He transported them to Spahn Ranch and
constructed an airtight, insular compound.

107
00:06:29,580 --> 00:06:29,938
There,

108
00:06:29,938 --> 00:06:32,679
he began poisoning their
minds with a demented

109
00:06:32,679 --> 00:06:35,420
apocalyptic dogma
christened “Helter Skelter”.

110
00:06:36,720 --> 00:06:40,200
[INVESTIGATOR] Through investigative
intelligence and evidence reconstruction,

111
00:06:40,200 --> 00:06:43,681
we determined that Manson's crimes
did not erupt spontaneously,

112
00:06:43,681 --> 00:06:48,100
but followed a distinct behavioral
escalation trajectory comprising five stages:

113
00:06:48,560 --> 00:06:52,900
Stage One: Juvenile
Delinquency and Manipulation.

114
00:06:53,980 --> 00:06:57,545
Manson refined his techniques of
coercive psychological control

115
00:06:57,545 --> 00:07:00,940
and pathological deception
through decades of incarceration.

116
00:07:02,240 --> 00:07:05,840
Stage Two: Cult Formation
and Mental Enslavement.

117
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:11,585
Administering high doses of LSD and
orchestrating communal sexual rituals

118
00:07:11,585 --> 00:07:15,690
to dismantle the personality frameworks
of young recruits at Spahn Ranch.

119
00:07:15,740 --> 00:07:20,460
Stage Three: The Nocturnal
“Creepy Crawling” Drills.

120
00:07:21,360 --> 00:07:24,855
Manson led disciples on midnight
burglaries into suburban homes,

121
00:07:24,855 --> 00:07:27,695
taking nothing but rearranging
furniture to rehearse

122
00:07:27,695 --> 00:07:30,480
their sense of omnipotence
and invisible dominance.

123
00:07:31,820 --> 00:07:34,900
Stage Four: Outbreak of
Armed Lethal Violence.

124
00:07:35,860 --> 00:07:37,084
In late July 1969,

125
00:07:37,084 --> 00:07:41,710
Manson critically shot drug supplier
Bernard Crowe and commanded the

126
00:07:41,710 --> 00:07:46,540
slaying of musician Gary Hinman
following a monetary extortion dispute.

127
00:07:47,680 --> 00:07:51,160
Stage Five: Climax of
Mass Symbolic Slaughter.

128
00:07:51,800 --> 00:07:54,446
With his threshold of
violence desensitized,

129
00:07:54,446 --> 00:07:57,333
Manson mandated the
coordinated strikes on Cielo

130
00:07:57,333 --> 00:08:00,460
Drive and Waverly Drive to
produce symbolic carnage.

131
00:08:00,880 --> 00:08:05,280
This trajectory exemplifies a
fundamental behavioral reality.

132
00:08:06,060 --> 00:08:08,349
When boundary-testing goes unchecked,

133
00:08:08,349 --> 00:08:12,680
the appetite for dark fantasy demands
ever more destructive realities.

134
00:08:14,620 --> 00:08:17,056
[HOST] What exact psychological
trigger ignited the

135
00:08:17,056 --> 00:08:19,880
murderous assault targeting
the Cielo Drive estate?

136
00:08:21,120 --> 00:08:25,271
Behind his messianic facade, Manson harbored
a pathological narcissistic craving:

137
00:08:25,271 --> 00:08:27,680
to become a rock star
greater than The Beatles.

138
00:08:28,740 --> 00:08:30,717
He aggressively pursued Terry Melcher,

139
00:08:30,717 --> 00:08:33,161
a prominent music producer
at Columbia Records,

140
00:08:33,161 --> 00:08:35,710
hoping to secure a commercial
recording contract.

141
00:08:35,760 --> 00:08:39,812
Yet when Melcher rejected his music
and declined to release an album,

142
00:08:39,812 --> 00:08:44,040
Manson's fragile ego suffered a
catastrophic narcissistic mortification.

143
00:08:44,500 --> 00:08:49,100
That feeling of humiliating rejection
curdled into a vengeful, destructive rage.

144
00:08:50,160 --> 00:08:54,640
[INVESTIGATOR] The secluded villa at
10050 Cielo Drive happened to be the exact

145
00:08:54,640 --> 00:08:59,680
property Terry Melcher previously
leased before Roman Polanski moved in.

146
00:09:00,820 --> 00:09:02,826
Even knowing Melcher had vacated,

147
00:09:02,826 --> 00:09:05,805
Manson selected this
location to purge his hatred

148
00:09:05,805 --> 00:09:08,480
against the Hollywood
elite who spurned him.

149
00:09:09,580 --> 00:09:12,436
He dispatched Charles Tex
Watson and three female

150
00:09:12,436 --> 00:09:15,466
followers to the residence
with an explicit command:

151
00:09:15,466 --> 00:09:17,040
eliminate everyone present.

152
00:09:18,100 --> 00:09:18,812
Forensically,

153
00:09:18,812 --> 00:09:21,553
we make a clear distinction
between Modus Operandi

154
00:09:21,553 --> 00:09:23,800
and Psychological Signature at the scene.

155
00:09:25,340 --> 00:09:28,536
The MO involved severing
phone lines, utilizing knives,

156
00:09:28,536 --> 00:09:32,080
and eliminating physical trace
evidence to escape undetected.

157
00:09:33,000 --> 00:09:33,653
Conversely,

158
00:09:33,653 --> 00:09:38,046
the immutable Signature lay in scrawling
“PIG” on the door and binding the

159
00:09:38,046 --> 00:09:42,260
victims with a single nylon rope to
stage a macabre theatrical display.

160
00:09:43,160 --> 00:09:44,962
[HOST] From a victimology perspective,

161
00:09:44,962 --> 00:09:47,927
the individuals gathered
at Cielo Drive and Waverly

162
00:09:47,927 --> 00:09:50,660
Drive bore absolutely no
grudge against Manson.

163
00:09:51,780 --> 00:09:55,709
Gifted actress Sharon Tate,
celebrity hairstylist Jay Sebring,

164
00:09:55,709 --> 00:09:57,926
Abigail Folger, Wojciech Frykowski,

165
00:09:57,926 --> 00:09:59,194
young Steven Parent,

166
00:09:59,194 --> 00:10:03,756
alongside Leno and Rosemary LaBianca
were human beings full of vitality,

167
00:10:03,756 --> 00:10:05,340
aspirations, and dignity.

168
00:10:06,280 --> 00:10:09,566
Their lives were extinguished
merely because they were chosen as

169
00:10:09,566 --> 00:10:13,160
disposable props to avenge the bruised
ego of a delusional narcissist.

170
00:10:14,380 --> 00:10:17,645
They deserve to be remembered in
the fullness of their humanity,

171
00:10:17,645 --> 00:10:19,940
rather than as mere
names bound to a tragedy.

172
00:10:22,260 --> 00:10:25,660
[HOST] When the identities of the
perpetrators were publicly disclosed,

173
00:10:25,660 --> 00:10:28,900
the entire nation fell into
profound psychological disbelief.

174
00:10:29,560 --> 00:10:32,237
Leading the ground assault
was Charles “Tex” Watson,

175
00:10:32,237 --> 00:10:35,480
a former honor student and
celebrated track athlete from Texas.

176
00:10:36,540 --> 00:10:39,572
Accompanying him were young women
originating from respectable,

177
00:10:39,572 --> 00:10:41,160
middle-class suburban households.

178
00:10:42,060 --> 00:10:44,474
Susan Atkins had sung in
her local church choir,

179
00:10:44,474 --> 00:10:46,939
Patricia Krenwinkel was
known for her gentleness,

180
00:10:46,939 --> 00:10:50,560
and Leslie Van Houten had been a
former high school homecoming princess.

181
00:10:51,740 --> 00:10:53,247
How could a cadre of educated,

182
00:10:53,247 --> 00:10:55,959
regular youths voluntarily
surrender their consciences

183
00:10:55,959 --> 00:10:58,420
to become remorseless
instruments of destruction?

184
00:10:59,840 --> 00:11:02,437
[PSYCHOLOGIST] To demystify
this terrifying transformation,

185
00:11:02,437 --> 00:11:06,982
we must examine social psychologist Kurt
Lewin's three-stage change paradigm,

186
00:11:06,982 --> 00:11:10,760
later adapted by Professor Edgar
Schein to explain brainwashing:

187
00:11:11,560 --> 00:11:16,023
Namely: Unfreezing the existing
self, Changing cognitive perceptions,

188
00:11:16,023 --> 00:11:18,740
and Refreezing newly conditioned behavior.

189
00:11:19,960 --> 00:11:23,180
Charles Manson possessed no
mystical supernatural powers.

190
00:11:23,800 --> 00:11:26,263
He was simply an intuitive
master at deploying

191
00:11:26,263 --> 00:11:28,780
the most ruthless tactics
of herd manipulation.

192
00:11:29,580 --> 00:11:33,551
This stripping of individual
identity was executed methodically,

193
00:11:33,551 --> 00:11:35,040
step by deliberate step.

194
00:11:36,950 --> 00:11:41,260
[HOST] Step one: Dismantling the former
identity, otherwise known as Unfreezing.

195
00:11:42,070 --> 00:11:45,382
Whenever a vulnerable newcomer
crossed the threshold of Spahn Ranch,

196
00:11:45,382 --> 00:11:48,060
Manson immediately unleashed
aggressive “Love Bombing”.

197
00:11:48,960 --> 00:11:51,365
He embraced them warmly,
stared into their eyes,

198
00:11:51,365 --> 00:11:53,420
and proclaimed they were flawless beings.

199
00:11:54,340 --> 00:11:56,757
He skillfully filled
the deep emotional voids

200
00:11:56,757 --> 00:11:59,120
created by neglectful
or fractured families.

201
00:12:00,140 --> 00:12:02,610
[PSYCHOLOGIST] Yet immediately
following that warm embrace

202
00:12:02,610 --> 00:12:05,080
was a cruel trap of
total social isolation.

203
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:08,815
Manson demanded that
recruits discard their money,

204
00:12:08,815 --> 00:12:13,300
surrender identification papers, and cut
off all communication with their parents.

205
00:12:14,040 --> 00:12:19,116
He stripped away their birth names,
assigning them bizarre aliases like Sadie,

206
00:12:19,116 --> 00:12:22,500
Katie, or Lulu to erase
their historical identities.

207
00:12:23,380 --> 00:12:24,970
During nocturnal ceremonies,

208
00:12:24,970 --> 00:12:28,660
he administered massive doses of
hallucinogenic LSD to his flock.

209
00:12:29,960 --> 00:12:35,020
Manson himself took only microdoses, ensuring
he retained lucid, predatory control.

210
00:12:35,800 --> 00:12:39,761
Under the combined assault of chemical
hallucinations and physical exhaustion,

211
00:12:39,761 --> 00:12:42,300
the recruits' ego boundaries
collapsed completely.

212
00:12:43,060 --> 00:12:46,520
Their minds rapidly transformed
into absolute blank slates.

213
00:12:47,620 --> 00:12:51,220
[HOST] Step two: Cognitive
reprogramming, the Changing phase.

214
00:12:52,360 --> 00:12:55,550
Once his disciples were robbed
of autonomous critical thinking,

215
00:12:55,550 --> 00:12:59,600
Manson systematically injected his
apocalyptic dogma into their receptive minds.

216
00:13:00,840 --> 00:13:04,568
[PSYCHOLOGIST] He twisted the lyrics of
The Beatles“ song ”Helter Skelter' from the

217
00:13:04,568 --> 00:13:08,570
White Album into a prophetic divine
scripture of an impending racial war.

218
00:13:08,620 --> 00:13:11,543
He crowned himself both
the reincarnation of

219
00:13:11,543 --> 00:13:14,400
Jesus Christ and the
sole arbiter of truth.

220
00:13:15,660 --> 00:13:18,474
To silence the dormant
conscience of his disciples,

221
00:13:18,474 --> 00:13:21,288
Manson drilled them in
Techniques of Neutralization

222
00:13:21,288 --> 00:13:23,660
outlined by criminologists
Sykes and Matza:

223
00:13:24,460 --> 00:13:25,977
Appeal to Higher Loyalties:

224
00:13:25,977 --> 00:13:29,460
Manson preached that killing in
Helter Skelter was not murder,

225
00:13:29,460 --> 00:13:33,000
but a transcendent spiritual
liberation serving universal love.

226
00:13:33,880 --> 00:13:39,011
Objectification and Dehumanization: Victims
were not human beings, but mere “Pigs” –

227
00:13:39,011 --> 00:13:44,020
corrupt avatars of a hypocritical capitalist
establishment destined for cleansing.

228
00:13:44,920 --> 00:13:49,468
Denial of Responsibility: Moral agency
was displaced onto cosmic destiny,

229
00:13:49,468 --> 00:13:54,140
reducing the disciples to blameless
instruments executing divine necessity.

230
00:13:54,980 --> 00:13:56,067
